# scitex-db CLI configuration limitation
#
# YAML configuration and automatic .env loading are not implemented by the CLI.
# ./config.yaml, SCITEX_DB_CONFIG and ~/.scitex/db/config.yaml do not provide
# defaults for inspect-db/check-health. Pass database paths and options directly.
# Malformed files are ignored; command success does not validate their contents.
#
# Portable project/user configuration under .scitex/db is an intended contract,
# not a supported loader or precedence chain. Do not set SCITEX_DB_CONFIG here
# expecting the CLI to consume it.
#
# Separately, Python store.resolve_store(env=...) reads the caller-named
# environment variable. Other libraries may define their own variables.
